            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "What the owner thought"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "\"Maybe it's just one thing. Fix the injectors, problem solved.\""
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "What it actually was"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Injector seal failure, timing chain tensioner wear, DPF clogging, EGR cooler failure, and diesel dilution in the oil."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "\"Fixing just one thing won't work - they'll take each other out again within months.\""
            },
